# Data Preparation and Cleaning

## 1. Overview

Data preparation was conducted using Microsoft Power BI and Power Query before importing the cleaned datasets into Tableau for analysis.

## 2. Datasets

- Orders
- Warehouse Monthly Inventory

## 3. Data Cleaning Activities

| Data Quality Issue | Action Taken | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Missing values | To be documented | Maintain data integrity |
| Incorrect data types | To be documented | Ensure accurate calculations |
| Duplicate records | To be documented | Prevent double-counting |
| Inconsistent categories | To be documented | Standardise categorical values |
| Invalid values | To be documented | Improve analytical reliability |

## 4. Data Validation

The cleaned datasets were reviewed to verify field types, missing values and consistency before being used for analysis.

## 5. Tools Used

- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- Microsoft Excel
